Bug fix: laser beam ammo 40→200 in MP GameConstants — matches SP 3.33s duration.

This commit modifies 2 files (+20/-2 lines), spanning 1 game server, 1 task/ops files.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
Root cause: server/shared/GameConstants.ts had laser_beam ammo:40, but SP WeaponTypes.ts
has ammo:200. Server applyLaserDamage() decrements 1 ammo/tick at TICK_RATE=60Hz:
  Before: 40/60 = 0.67s (instant from user's perspective)
  After:  200/60 = 3.33s (matches SP duration)

